==Russian==
===Etymology=== 
From {{etyl|cu|ru}} {{term|гласу|lang=cu}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|ru}} {{m|ine-pro|*gal(o)s-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*glōs-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*golH-so-||voice, cry}}.
===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈɡlas.nɨj/|lang=ru}}

===Adjective===
{{ru-adj|гла́сный}}

# {{context|linguistics|lang=ru}} [[vowel]]
